  "narrative": {
    "schema": "scholar-portrait-0.1",
    "field": {
      "en": "RNA biology, CRISPR-Cas mechanism, and genome-engineering tool development",
      "zh": "RNA生物学、CRISPR-Cas机制与基因组工程工具开发"
    },
    "theme": {
      "en": "Turning mechanistic dissection of RNA-guided enzymes into programmable, engineered instruments",
      "zh": "把RNA引导酶的机制解析转化为可编程的工程化工具"
    },
    "lead": {
      "en": "Across these papers the recurring move is to take an RNA-guided system apart mechanistically and then rebuild it as a controllable tool. Biochemical and structural work on Cas9 target search, PAM dependence, and activation (W1970196890, W2142515819) is paired with high-throughput specificity profiling (W2149402050) and with conversion into dCas9-based interference and activation (W2160051211, W2101749257). The same program extends outward: Cas12a's collateral cleavage becomes a property to characterize (W2787024379), and a new VIPR system is pushed from discovery through structural explanation to programmable control (W7213444707, W7213466398). Even reviews are maps of a toolkit and its mechanisms (W2050480410, W2888908334).",
      "zh": "这批论文反复出现的做法是：先把一个RNA引导系统在机制上拆开，再把它重建为可控制的工具。对Cas9靶标搜索、PAM依赖与激活的生化与结构研究（W1970196890、W2142515819），与高通量脱靶特异性分析（W2149402050）并列，并进一步转化为基于dCas9的干扰与激活平台（W2160051211、W2101749257）。这套思路向外延伸：Cas12a的旁切活性成为被刻画的性质（W2787024379），而新发现的VIPR系统则从发现推进到结构解释和可编程调控（W7213444707、W7213466398）。连综述也像工具箱及其机制的地图（W2050480410、W2888908334）。"
    },
    "person": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Har Gobind Khorana",
        "zh": "哈尔·戈宾德·霍拉纳"
      },
      "wikiTitle": "Har_Gobind_Khorana",
      "connection": {
        "en": "Khorana's intellectual practice was to decode a biological code through painstaking chemistry and then deliberately synthesize artificial constructs to test and extend it. These papers share that rhythm: characterize how guide RNA and PAM determine targeting (W1970196890, W2554763217), then design single-guide RNA chimeras and re-specified PAM variants that put the code under human control (W2045435533, W7202208866). The VIPR work adds a noncanonical, noncontiguous recognition code, a compositional motif rule rather like an alphabet of motifs (W7213444707, W7213466398).",
        "zh": "霍拉纳的治学方式，是用艰苦的化学方法破译一种生物密码，再刻意合成人工构建物来检验并拓展它。这批论文有同样的节律：先刻画向导RNA与PAM如何决定靶向（W1970196890、W2554763217），再设计单链向导RNA嵌合体与重定PAM变体，把这一密码置于人的控制之下（W2045435533、W7202208866）。VIPR工作又引入一种非典型、非连续识别的密码，其基序组合规则近乎一套字母表（W7213444707、W7213466398）。"
      },
      "paperIds": [
        "W1970196890",
        "W2554763217",
        "W2045435533",
        "W7202208866"
      ],
      "boundary": {
        "en": "Khorana synthesized genes and polynucleotides by hand for fundamental questions; much of this work engineers proteins and vectors aimed at clinical and screening applications, so the shared style is code-and-craft, not shared subject.",
        "zh": "霍拉纳为回答基础问题而手工合成基因与多核苷酸；这批研究则多把蛋白与载体的工程设计指向临床与筛选应用，因此相通的是“解读密码并动手构造”的方式，而非研究题材。"
      }
    },
    "traits": [
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Mechanism first, then redesign",
          "zh": "先解析机制，再重新设计"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Enzymatic behavior is pinned down before engineering. Single-molecule and biochemical interrogation shows PAM-dependent target search and directional R-loop initiation (W1970196890); crystal and EM structures reveal RNA-triggered conformational activation (W2142515819). Only then is dCas9 repurposed as an RNA-guided repressor and activator in bacteria and eukaryotes (W2160051211, W2101749257).",
          "zh": "工程化之前先把酶的运行方式确定下来。单分子与生化分析显示PAM依赖的靶标搜索和方向性R环起始（W1970196890）；晶体与电镜结构揭示RNA触发的构象激活（W2142515819）。随后dCas9才被改造为细菌和真核细胞中的RNA引导抑制器与激活器（W2160051211、W2101749257）。"
        },
        "paperIds": [
          "W1970196890",
          "W2142515819",
          "W2160051211",
          "W2101749257"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Specificity measured at scale",
          "zh": "规模化测量特异性"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "A recurring instrument is the high-throughput assay. In vitro selection against 10^12 candidate sites maps off-target cleavage and shows specificity extends beyond a short seed (W2149402050). A yeast selection platform screens many SpCas9 variants and ranks them on reciprocal PAM selectivity and kinetics (W7202208866). The measurement defines the engineering target.",
          "zh": "高通量分析是反复出现的工具。针对10^12个候选位点的体外选择勾勒出脱靶切割图谱，并显示特异性超出很短的种子序列（W2149402050）。酵母选择平台筛选大量SpCas9变体，并按互易PAM选择性与动力学排序（W7202208866）。测量本身定义了工程目标。"
        },
        "paperIds": [
          "W2149402050",
          "W7202208866"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "From natural systems to programmable modules",
          "zh": "从天然系统到可编程模块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Discovery and toolmaking feed each other. Cas12a's target-triggered ssDNA trans-cleavage is characterized as a defining type V property (W2787024379); the dual-RNA structure becomes a single-guide chimera (W2045435533); and VIPR's gapped triplex recognition is described and then shown to support programmable transcriptional repression (W7213466398, W7213444707).",
          "zh": "发现与造工具互相滋养。Cas12a靶标触发的单链DNA旁切被刻画为V型的根本性质（W2787024379）；双RNA结构被改写为单链向导嵌合体（W2045435533）；VIPR的缺口三链识别被描述，并被证明可支持可编程转录抑制（W7213466398、W7213444707）。"
        },
        "paperIds": [
          "W2787024379",
          "W2045435533",
          "W7213466398",
          "W7213444707"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      {
        "name": {
          "en": "Werner Arber",
          "zh": "维尔纳·阿尔伯"
        },
        "wikiTitle": "Werner_Arber",
        "reason": {
          "en": "Secondary because his focus was restriction-modification as bacterial defense rather than toolkit engineering; still apt as a model of interpreting host-virus conflicts mechanistically, paralleling the VIPR origin-of-immunity story (W7213444707, W7222818586).",
          "zh": "作为次选，因为他的重心是作为细菌防御的限制-修饰系统，而非工具箱工程；但仍契合于以机制方式解读宿主-病毒冲突，与VIPR免疫起源的叙事相呼应（W7213444707、W7222818586）。"
        },
        "paperIds": [
          "W7213444707",
          "W7222818586"
        ]
      }
    ],
